@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Forehand feed and step in
@track Out of 10
Forehand feed and step in, four minutes. From behind the short line, tap a soft, high feed so it
lands near the short line. Get behind it, feet facing the side wall, stomp your front foot, and
drive deep: a racket head above the service line, first bounce behind the service box. Halfway, move
up for drives from the front court, then back for the ladder check in the last thirty seconds. Phase
two target: seven out of ten with the second bounce at the back wall, misses in between allowed.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 4:00
0:00 [go]
8% Get behind the ball.
22% Stomp, and let your weight go forward.
36% Feed it higher if you're rushed.
50% Now the front court. A step in front of the short line, a racket length off the side wall. Feed a short one, and drive it straight to length.
63% Go around the ball, not at it.
78% Turn your shoulders more than feels natural. Finish high, to the front wall.
-0:30 Ladder check. Back behind the short line: score the next ten. Target: seven out of ten to the back wall.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]
